#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0388 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a parameter, there is more than one value of BTOXGRHN for a given value of BTOXGRH, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1
#expectViolationAt row=2
dataset ADLBC
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BTOXGRHN type=Char
col BTOXGRH type=Char
---
HEIGHT | Label A | A
HEIGHT | Different Label | A
HEIGHT | Label B | B
---
